    """Finish working in the current kit. Clears kit, design, type, mode and source from session state.
    [👤compose📚engine💻engine🔖mcp🛠️finishworkinginkit](repo://p/u/compose/b/l/engine/f/engine.py/s/Mcp/d/i/finish_working_in_kit)
